message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "Algebraic ratios between exact prime-race crossings"
abstract: "On each theta field at most three exact hits of magnitude 1.9735 can share algebraic height ratios. At least 3,274 inequivalent hits on 547/727 finish by exp(12500). The joint three-hit bound is unconditional through 2^1582 and sufficiently far out. Dirichlet GRH connects the ranges."
